B.a06=s(["No sign-up or login is needed. All content can be read right away.","Favorites, bookmarks, history, search history and downloads are kept on this device and are not uploaded.","To learn which chapters are read and where readers stop, the app sends anonymous usage statistics to our server: opening the app, which chapter and page you view, which chapters you finish, how long each reading session lasts, and the reading language, text size and reading mode at the time, together with an anonymous device ID, the app version and the system type. No personal information such as your name, contact details, location or contacts is included. Without a connection, they are kept on this device and sent together once you are online.","Chapter 1 comes with the app; other chapters are fetched from our server when you open or download them. Downloads request only the comic files, without a device ID or reading history.","When you send feedback, the issue type, description, contact details (if you gave any), the book, chapter, page and panel, and the reading language are sent to our server, together with a randomly generated anonymous device ID, the app version and the system type (Android, iOS or web), so that we can find the problem and reply to you. Without a connection, it is kept on this device and sent automatically once you are online.","When the app runs into an error, only a short error summary is kept in memory. It is cleared when the app closes and is never uploaded.","No ad tracking, and no pop-ups asking for ratings, subscriptions or notification permission while you read.","Clearing the browser or app data also clears these records on this device, and the anonymous device ID is replaced with a new one."],t.s)
